<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Guide Overwatch : compos et utilités des 53 héros</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@1,600;1,700&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#EDF1F6; --surface:#FFFFFF; --ink:#13202F; --muted:#56667A; --line:#D3DCE7; --bar:#DCE5EF;
  --tank:#2F6FD0; --dgt:#D2473B; --sup:#238A68;
  --tank-bg:#E3EDFB; --dgt-bg:#FBE6E3; --sup-bg:#DFF3EB;
  --accent:#F28A1B; --focus:#1B5FC9;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
    --bg:#0E1622; --surface:#16212F; --ink:#E7EDF5; --muted:#9AA9BC; --line:#2A3A4E; --bar:#1D2A3B;
    --tank:#6AA2F2; --dgt:#F07A6D; --sup:#4FC79C;
    --tank-bg:#1B2C47; --dgt-bg:#3A201F; --sup-bg:#16352B;
    --accent:#F7A33B; --focus:#8DBBFF;
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#0E1622; --surface:#16212F; --ink:#E7EDF5; --muted:#9AA9BC; --line:#2A3A4E; --bar:#1D2A3B;
  --tank:#6AA2F2; --dgt:#F07A6D; --sup:#4FC79C;
  --tank-bg:#1B2C47; --dgt-bg:#3A201F; --sup-bg:#16352B;
  --accent:#F7A33B; --focus:#8DBBFF;
}
:root{box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);height:100%}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
body{margin:0;min-height:100%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 16px/1.55 'Barlow','Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:4px}
.display{font-family:'Barlow Condensed','Arial Narrow','Roboto Condensed',Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}
.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px}

/* en-tête */
.top{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:20;background:var(--surface);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.top .wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px 24px}
.brand{padding:12px 0 6px}
.brand h1{margin:0;font-size:30px;line-height:1.05}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%;scrollbar-width:none}
.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.tab{background:none;border:0;border-bottom:4px solid transparent;padding:12px 14px 10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.tab[aria-selected="true"]{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}

.intro{padding:22px 0 8px}
.intro p{margin:0 0 8px;max-width:70ch;font-size:18px}
.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:10px}
.legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}

/* pastilles de héros */
.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;border:1.5px solid var(--c);background:var(--cb);color:var(--ink);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 6px 6px 0;text-align:left}
.chip:hover{filter:brightness(.97)}
.r-tank{--c:var(--tank);--cb:var(--tank-bg)}
.r-dgt{--c:var(--dgt);--cb:var(--dgt-bg)}
.r-sup{--c:var(--sup);--cb:var(--sup-bg)}
.chip.l2{background:transparent;border-style:dashed;font-weight:500}
.qm{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);margin-left:2px}
.swatch{display:inline-block;width:26px;height:14px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--tank);background:var(--tank-bg)}
.swatch.dash{background:transparent;border-style:dashed}

/* choix de compo */
.pick{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:10px;margin:16px 0 20px}
.cp{background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px}
.cp svg{width:100%;max-width:150px;height:auto}
.cp .nm{font-size:22px;line-height:1}
.cp[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--surface);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--accent) inset}
.dia .a{fill:var(--tank)}
.dia .f{fill:var(--dgt)}
.dia .ln{stroke:var(--ink);fill:none;stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round}
.dia .dash{stroke-dasharray:5 5;stroke-width:1.8;opacity:.75}
.dia .thick{stroke-width:5}
.dia .arc{stroke:var(--sup);stroke-width:6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round}
.dia .sq{fill:var(--sup)}
.dia .ah{fill:var(--ink);stroke:none}

/* panneau */
.panel{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:24px}
.phead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,300px) 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}
.phead svg{width:100%;height:auto;background:var(--bar);border-radius:10px;padding:6px}
.phead h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:40px;line-height:1}
.phead p{margin:0;font-size:18px;max-width:60ch}
.cols3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
.rolecol{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;min-width:0}
.rolebar{background:var(--bar);padding:6px 12px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2}
.rolebar.r-tank{color:var(--tank)} .rolebar.r-dgt{color:var(--dgt)} .rolebar.r-sup{color:var(--sup)}
.rolebody{padding:12px 12px 6px;min-height:56px}
.none{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin:0 0 8px}
.hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 0}
.cols2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
.box{border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:6px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px}
.box h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2}
.box ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px}
.box li{margin:0 0 6px}
.box.good{border-left-color:var(--sup)} .box.bad{border-left-color:var(--dgt)}
.box.play{border-left-color:var(--tank)} .box.counter{border-left-color:var(--accent)}
.inf{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-left:4px}
.teams{margin-top:18px}
.teams h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:24px}
.team{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px 4px;margin-bottom:10px}
.team .tt{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.src{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin:16px 0 0}
.src a{color:inherit}

/* utilités */
.upick{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:16px 0 20px}
.up{background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 16px;font-weight:600}
.up[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--accent) inset}
.udef{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 6px;max-width:70ch}
.urows{margin-top:14px}
.urole{margin:14px 0 4px;font-size:24px}
.urole.r-tank{color:var(--tank)} .urole.r-dgt{color:var(--dgt)} .urole.r-sup{color:var(--sup)}
.urow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:6px 14px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.urow .why{color:var(--ink)}

/* tableau */
.mrow{margin-bottom:22px}
.mrow h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:32px;line-height:1}

/* héros */
.tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:16px 0}
.tools input[type=search]{flex:1 1 220px;min-width:0;padding:10px 14px;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:inherit}
.rf{background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 16px;font-weight:600}
.rf[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--accent) inset}
.sub{margin:10px 0 6px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2}
.sub small{display:block;font-family:'Barlow','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

/* fiche */
dialog{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);padding:0;width:min(560px,calc(100vw - 24px));max-height:calc(100vh - 40px)}
dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(8,14,22,.6)}
.dlg{padding:20px 20px 16px}
.dlg h2{margin:0;font-size:40px;line-height:1}
.dlg .meta{color:var(--muted);margin:2px 0 12px}
.dlg h3{margin:14px 0 6px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2}
.dlg ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px}
.dlg li{margin:0 0 4px}
.dlg .close{margin-top:14px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--surface);border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 18px;font-weight:600}

footer{padding:8px 0 40px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
footer p{margin:0 0 6px;max-width:80ch}
[hidden]{display:none !important}

@media (max-width:900px){
  .pick{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .phead{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .phead svg{max-width:340px}
}
@media (max-width:720px){
  .cols3,.cols2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .urow{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .brand h1{font-size:26px}
  .phead h2{font-size:34px}
  .panel{padding:16px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none !important;scroll-behavior:auto !important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand"><h1 class="display">Guide Overwatch</h1></div>
    <nav class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Sections du guide">
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-compos" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="s-compos" data-tab="compos">Par compo</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-utils" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="s-utils" data-tab="utils">Par utilité</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-matrix" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="s-matrix" data-tab="matrix">Tableau</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-heros" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="s-heros" data-tab="heros">Tous les héros</button>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <section class="intro">
    <p>Overwatch est bien plus difficile qu'il n'en a l'air. Ce guide classe les 53 héros par compo et par utilité, pour comprendre qui joue avec qui et pourquoi.</p>
    <p>Touche un nom pour ouvrir la fiche du héros.</p>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="swatch"></i>Plein : le héros joue surtout cette compo</span>
      <span><i class="swatch dash"></i>Contour : il peut aussi y jouer</span>
      <span><b>?</b> Placement à confirmer</span>
      <span><b>◇</b> Déduction, pas une source</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="s-compos" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-compos">
    <div class="pick" id="comp-pick"></div>
    <div class="panel" id="comp-panel"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="s-utils" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-utils" hidden>
    <div class="upick" id="util-pick"></div>
    <div class="panel" id="util-panel"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="s-matrix" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-matrix" hidden>
    <div class="panel" id="matrix"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="s-heros" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-heros" hidden>
    <div class="tools">
      <input type="search" id="q" placeholder="Chercher un héros" aria-label="Chercher un héros">
      <button class="rf" data-role="all" aria-pressed="true">Tous</button>
      <button class="rf" data-role="tank" aria-pressed="false">Tank</button>
      <button class="rf" data-role="dgt" aria-pressed="false">Dégâts</button>
      <button class="rf" data-role="sup" aria-pressed="false">Soutien</button>
    </div>
    <div class="panel" id="all-heroes"></div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="wrap">
  <p>Les kits des héros récents (Domina, Mizuki, Shion, Sierra, D.Mon, Vendetta, Anran, Jetpack Cat, Emre, Wuyang, Freja) ont été relus dans des guides et wikis. Les équilibrages changent : un héros peut évoluer d'une saison à l'autre.</p>
  <p>Les compos Turtle et Flank n'ont pas de guide de référence : leurs textes sont surtout des déductions (◇) à confirmer.</p>
</footer>

<dialog id="hd" aria-labelledby="hd-title"><div class="dlg" id="hd-body"></div></dialog>

